    "text": "Exactly. So the Philippines has these licensed offshore gaming operators — POGOs — that operate in a legal gray area. Criminals exploit that. They set up scam call centers, run romance fraud schemes, human trafficking rings, all while hiding under the umbrella of what looks like a legitimate gaming business. It's a perfect cover because there's already a lot of money moving around, a lot of international connections.",
    "type": "deep_dive"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "host1",
    "text": "That's terrifying. And what does this mean for people? I mean, are we talking about victims here?",
    "type": "deep_dive"
  },
  {
