    "type": "deep_dive"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "host1",
    "text": "So there's a supermassive black hole at the center of our galaxy right now? That's both fascinating and slightly terrifying, honestly.",
    "type": "listener_request"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "host2",
    "text": "It is wild, but don't worry — we're about 26,000 light-years away from it, so we're completely safe.",
    "type": "deep_dive"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "host1",
    "text": "Marcus, thanks so much for that question. Seriously, we love getting calls like this. If you're listening and you've got a question about space, science, or anything else, give us a call. That's what Audexa Radio is all about. Stick around — we've got weather and traffic coming up right after this.",
